      "moduleId": "rn_8K4rhNpfVqrR8pHF::L1",
      "stem": "A hospital needs to image a broken bone and to sterilise sealed surgical tools. State which band serves each task.",
      "misconceptionClass": "application transfer",
      "kind": "application",
      "modelAnswer": "X-rays image the bone, because denser material absorbs them and reveals internal structure; gamma rays sterilise the sealed tools, because gamma kills bacteria even through packaging.",
